[{"id":"MzA-q01","number":1,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>The farthest South that an observer on the Earth can see Polaris is ...</p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]-->A. Arctic Circle</p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]-->B. Antartic Circle</p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]-->C. Equator</p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]-->D. The Tropic of Cancer</p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]-->E. The Tropic of Capricorn</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTM5Mw"},{"id":"MzA-q02","number":2,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Which of the following statements show that the Einstein relativistic theory is correct?</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">1)&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">The star behind the Sun is observable during Total Solar Eclipse</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">2)&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">The short lived cosmic ray which is created in upper atmosphere can be observed in larger amount than expected</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">3)&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">The orbit of Mercury differ from the prediction by Newton law but fit with the Einstein relativisctic prediction</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">4)&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Comet size is larger when it approach the Sun</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Choose</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">A.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">If 1, 2, and 3 correct</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">B.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">If 1 and 3 correct</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">C.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">If 2 and 4 correct</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">D. I</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">f only 4 correct</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">E.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">If all answer are </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">correct</span></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTM5Ng"},{"id":"MzA-q03","number":3,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Of the seven other planets, the one that encounter the closest to the Earth is</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">A.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Mars</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">B.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Venus</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">C.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Mercury</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">D.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Jupiter</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">E.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Saturn</span></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTM5Nw"},{"id":"MzA-q04","number":4,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>--</p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQwNQ"},{"id":"MzA-q05","number":5,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">The general theory of stellar evolution indicates that</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">A.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">The Sun will change to a pulsating star within about one million years</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">B.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">The Sun will have its present size and brightness for about 4,5 billion years</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">C.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">The Sun&rsquo;s brightness will decrease at the rate of about one percent per year during the next 100 years</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">D.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">The Sun&rsquo;s brightness will increase by about one percent per year during the next 100 years</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">E.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">The Sun will explode as a Supernova on it&rsquo;s&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">death</span></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTM5OA"},{"id":"MzA-q06","number":6,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Momentum sudut revolusi Bumi mengelilingi Matahari :</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">1)&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Arahnya membentuk sudut 23,5</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">0 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">dengan momentum sudut rotasi Bumi</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">2)&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Tetap meskipun jarak Bumi-Matahari berubah-ubah karena orbit Bumi yang elips</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">3)&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Lebih besar daripada momentum sudut rotasi Bumi</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">4)&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Berlawanan arah dengan momentum sudut revolusi Mars</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Untuk soal di atas pilihlah :</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">A.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Jika 1, 2 dan 3 benar</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">B.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Jika 1 dan 3 benar</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">C.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Jika 2 dan 4 benar</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">D.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Jika 4 saja benar</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">E.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Jika semua </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">benar</span></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTM5OQ"},{"id":"MzA-q07","number":7,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Sebuah planet X pada malam hari temperaturnya 27</span><sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">0</span></sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">C sedangkan pada waktu siang suhunya mencapai 47</span><sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">0</span></sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">C. Jika planet tersebut diasumsikan sebagai benda hitam, berapakah rasio energi pada siang dan malam hari yang dipancarkannya?</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">A.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Ls = 1,3 Lm</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">B.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Ls = 1,5 Lm</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">C.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Ls = 1,7 Lm</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">D.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Ls = 1,9 Lm</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">E.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Ls = 2,1 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Lm</span></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQwMA"},{"id":"MzA-q08","number":8,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Titik perpotongan antara ekuator langit dengan ekliptika tempat matahari berada pada tanggal 23 September yaitu Autumnal Equinox mempunyai koordinat (asensiorekta, deklinasi) :</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\">A. 00</span><sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">h</span></sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">,00</span><sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">0</span></sup></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\">B. 06</span><sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">h</span></sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">, +23</span><sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">0</span></sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">,5</span></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQwNg"},{"id":"MzA-q09","number":9,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Komposisi kimia lapisan luar Matahari dipelajari terutama dari telaah :</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">A.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Pergeseran Doppler dari garis hidrogen Balmer</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">B.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Penerapan Hukum Wien pada spektrum Matahari</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">C.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Kerapatan rata-rata Matahari secara keseluruhan</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">D.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Garis-garis absorpsi dari spektrum cahaya fotosfer</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">E.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Pengamatan letupan (flare) Matahari saat aktifitas maksimum </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Matahari</span></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQwMQ"},{"id":"MzA-q10","number":10,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Pilih mana yang BENAR :</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">A.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Absorbsi atmosfer pada berbagai jarak zenit adalah sama</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">B.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Massa udara menurun dengan makin besar jarak zenit</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">C.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Peredaman cahaya bintang oleh atmosfer pada zenit menurun dengan makin besarnya panjang gelombang</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">D.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Di dekat cakrawala atmosfer Bumi menyebabkan bintang berlokasi lebih rendah dari posisi sebenarnya</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">E.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Di dekat cakrawala atmosfer Bumi tidak memberi pengaruh apapun pada posisi </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">bintang</span></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQwMg"},{"id":"MzA-q11","number":11,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Sebuah bintang akan menjadi Black Hole apabila kecepatan lepas bintang lebih besar atau sama dengan kecepatan cahaya. Radius bintang pada kondisi ini disebut dengan radius Schwarzchild. Tentukanlah massa dari sebuah black hole apabila radius Schawarzchildnya 30 km.</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">A.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">2 x&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span><sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">31</span></sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">kg</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">B.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">3 x&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span><sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">31</span></sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">kg</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">C.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">4 x&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span><sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">31</span></sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">kg</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">D.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">5 x 10</span><sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">31 </span></sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">kg</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-top: 4.6pt; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo1; tab-stops: 41.7pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">E.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">6 x&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span><sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">31</span></sup>&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">kg</span></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQwMw"},{"id":"MzA-q12","number":12,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Bila dalam kalender Matahari Gregorian tanggal 1 Januari suatu tahun kabisat bertepatan dengan hari Ahad/Minggu, maka pada satu tahun kabisat setiap awal bulan yang bertepatan dengan hari Kamis adalah</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">A.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Maret dan November</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">B.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Juli dan Oktober</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">C.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Hanya bulan Maret</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">D.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">April dan Desember</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">E.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Agustus dan </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">November</span></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQwNA"},{"id":"MzA-q13","number":13,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Kedudukan satelit sebagai stasiun relay di angkasa, dikenal dengan beberapa konfigurasi, misalnya topologi simplex, topologi point to point (p2p), topologi star dan topologi mesh. LASO adalah sistim yang dikembangkan orang untuk &lsquo;mengikat bumi&rsquo; dengan menempatkan tiga satelit di angkasa, ditempatkan pada jarak tertentu sehingga seluruh permukaan Bumi bisa diamati. Jika jejari bumi adalah R, maka tinggi satelit dari&nbsp; permukaan Bumi dalam topologi LASO adalah :</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\">A. 0,25 R</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\">B. 0,50 R</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\">C. 0,75 R</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\">D. 1,00 R</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\">E.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">1,25 R</span></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQwNw"},{"id":"MzA-q14","number":14,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Suatu observatorium besar telah menemukan 46 planet di luat Tata Surya. Planet-planet yang telah ditemukan itu kemudian dikelompokkan dalam dua kategori sebagai planet gas dan planet berpermukaan keras, kemudian diklasifikasikan juga di dalam kategori yang lain, planet berotasi cepat dan berotasi lambat. Jika planet gas jumlahnya 31, planet yang berotasi lambat 22, planet yang berpermukaan keras dan berotasi cepat ada 8, maka perhatikan pernyataan-pernyataan berikut ini :</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">1)&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Planet gas dan berotasi cepat ada 16</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">2)&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Planet berpermukaan keras dan berotasi lambat ada 19</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">3)&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Planet gas dan berotasi lambat ada 15</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">4)&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Planet berpermukaan keras ada 21</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Untuk pernyataan-pernyataan di atas, maka :</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">A.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">1, 2 dan 3 benar</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">B.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">1 dan 3 benar</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">C.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">2 dan 4 benar</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">D.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">4 saja benar</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">E.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Semua </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">benar</span></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQwOA"},{"id":"MzA-q15","number":15,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Prof. Astroitb baru saja menemukan dua exoplanet (extra-solar planets) yang masih sangat muda. Dari kandungan hidrogen yang dimiliki dapat disimpulkan perbandingan&nbsp; umur kedua planet saat ini adalah A : B = 3 : 4. Dari cara yang lain didapat kesimpulan, enam juga tahun yang lalu perbandingannya adalah A : B = 5 : 7. Berapakah umur kedua exoplanet tersebut?</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">A.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Umur planet A = 36 juta tahun dan umur planet B = 48 juta tahun</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">B.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Umur planet A = 30 juta tahun dan umur planet B = 40 juta </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">tahun</span></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQwOQ"},{"id":"MzA-q16","number":16,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Sebuah balok bermassa 0,5 kg dihubungkan dengan sebuah pegas ringan dengan konstanta&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">200 N/m. Kemudian sistem tersebut berosilasi harmonis. Jika diketahui simpangan maksimumnya adalah 3 cm, maka kecepatan maksimum adalah</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">A.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">0,1 m/s</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">B.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">0,6 m/s</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">C.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">1 m/s</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">D.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">1,5 m/s</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">E.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">2 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">m/s</span></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQxMA"},{"id":"MzA-q17","number":17,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Misalkan <img title=\"\\alpha\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\alpha\" />&nbsp;dan&nbsp;</span><img title=\"\\beta\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\beta\" />&nbsp;masing-masing adalah sudut datang dan sudut bias dari cahaya terhadap garis normal. Jika cahaya datang dari udara ke kaca, maka hubungan yang benar antara<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;<img title=\"\\alpha\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\alpha\" />&nbsp;dan&nbsp;</span><img title=\"\\beta\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\beta\" />&nbsp;adalah</p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">A.&nbsp;<img title=\"\\alpha &gt; \\beta\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\alpha&amp;space;&gt;&amp;space;\\beta\" /></span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">B.&nbsp;<img title=\"\\alpha &lt; \\beta\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\alpha&amp;space;&lt;&amp;space;\\beta\" /></span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">C.&nbsp;<img title=\"\\alpha = \\beta\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\alpha&amp;space;=&amp;space;\\beta\" /></span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">D. <img title=\"\\alpha &gt; 2\\beta\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\alpha&amp;space;&gt;&amp;space;2\\beta\" /></span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">E.&nbsp;<img title=\"\\alpha &gt; 4\\beta\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\alpha&amp;space;&gt;&amp;space;4\\beta\" /></span></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQxMQ"},{"id":"MzA-q18","number":18,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Dua buah benda bergerak dalam suatu medan gravitasi yang seragan (g = 10 m/s</span><sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span></sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">). Pada saat awal, kedua benda berada pada posisi yang sama dan bergerak dengan kecepatan vA = 16 m/s dan vB = 4 m/s horizontal dan berlawanan arah. Tentukan jarak kedua partikel ketika kecepatan keduanya saling tegak lurus !</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\">A. 1,60 m</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\">B. 1,65 m</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\">C. 1,70 m</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\">D. 1,80 m</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\">E.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">1,90 m</span></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQxMg"},{"id":"MzA-q19","number":19,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Suatu cermin cekung dan cembung dengan jari-jari kelengkungan yang sama 20 cm ditempatkan saling berhadapan dengan jarak 40 cm. Suatu benda dengan tinggi 7 cm ditempatkan di tengah-tengah kedua cermin. Tinggi bayangan akhir jika pemantulan terjadi oleh cermin cembung kemudian oleh cermin cekung adalah</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">A.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">3 cm, tegak</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\">E.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">2 cm, terbalik</span></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQxMw"},{"id":"MzA-q20","number":20,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Sebuah ayunan yang massa bandulnya <img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?M\" /> dinaikkan pada ketinggian&nbsp;<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?H\" /> dan kemudian dilepaskan. Pada bagian terendah dari lintasannya, bandul membentur suatu massa&nbsp;<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?m\" /> yang mula-mula diam di atas permukaan mendatar licin. Apabila setelah bertumbukan kedua benda saling menempel, maka ketinggian h yang akan dicapai keduanya adalah</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"../../../../uploads/image/file/411/1.jpg\" style=\"margin-left:auto; margin-right:auto\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20191008064344.png\" style=\"height:162px; width:255px\" /></p>","choices":["&nbsp;<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\left&amp;space;(&amp;space;\\frac{m}{M+m}&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;)^{2}H\" />","<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\left&amp;space;(&amp;space;\\frac{m}{M+m}&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;)H^{2}\" />","<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\left&amp;space;(&amp;space;\\frac{M}{M+m}&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;)^{2}H\" />","<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\left&amp;space;(&amp;space;\\frac{M}{M+m}&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;)H^{2}\" />","<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\left&amp;space;(&amp;space;\\frac{M}{M+m}&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;)^{2}H^{2}\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQxNA"},{"id":"MzA-q21","number":21,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Sebuah objek bercahaya dan suatu layar berada pada jarak yang tetap <em>D</em>. Sebuah lensa cembung yang ditempatkan di antara objek dan layar. Ketika posisi lensa berada pada jarak <em>a</em>&nbsp;dari objek, terbentuk bayangan nyata di layar. Kemudian lensa digeser mendekati objek hingga berada pada jarak <em>b</em>&nbsp;dari objek dan terbentuk juga bayangan nyata pada layar, maka selisih jarak <em>a</em> - <em>b</em>&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">adalah</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\">A.&nbsp;<img title=\"\\sqrt{D\\left ( D+2f \\right )}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\sqrt{D\\left&amp;space;(&amp;space;D+2f&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;)}\" /></span></p><p>B. <img title=\"\\sqrt{D\\left ( D-4f \\right )}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\sqrt{D\\left&amp;space;(&amp;space;D-4f&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;)}\" /></p><p>C. <img title=\"\\sqrt{2D\\left ( D+f \\right )}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\sqrt{2D\\left&amp;space;(&amp;space;D+f&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;)}\" /></p><p>D. <img title=\"\\sqrt{D\\left ( 2D-f \\right )}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\sqrt{D\\left&amp;space;(&amp;space;2D-f&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;)}\" /></p><p>E. <img title=\"\\sqrt{2D\\left ( D-f \\right )}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\sqrt{2D\\left&amp;space;(&amp;space;D-f&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;)}\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQxNQ"},{"id":"MzA-q22","number":22,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Suatu benda meluncur di sepanjang permukaan talang yang licin seperti pada gambar.<img alt=\"\" src=\"../../../../uploads/image/file/412/2.jpg\" style=\"height:180px; width:499px\" /></p><p>Berapa jarak horizontal dihitung dari ujung talang ketika sampai di tanah?</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20191008061337.jpg\" style=\"height:90px; width:250px\" /></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]-->A.&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\dpi{100}&amp;space;\\fn_phv&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;\\dpi{100}&amp;space;\\fn_phv&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;\\dpi{100}&amp;space;\\fn_phv&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;3\\;&amp;space;m\" /></p><p>B.&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\dpi{100}&amp;space;\\fn_phv&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;\\dpi{100}&amp;space;\\fn_phv&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;\\dpi{100}&amp;space;\\fn_phv&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;3-\\sqrt{3}\\;&amp;space;m\" /></p><p>C.&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\dpi{100}&amp;space;\\fn_phv&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;\\dpi{100}&amp;space;\\fn_phv&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;3\\,&amp;space;+\\sqrt{3}\\;&amp;space;m\" /></p><p>D.&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\dpi{100}&amp;space;\\fn_phv&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;\\dpi{100}&amp;space;\\fn_phv&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;\\sqrt{3}\\;&amp;space;m\" /></p><p>E.&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\dpi{100}&amp;space;\\fn_phv&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;\\dpi{100}&amp;space;\\fn_phv&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;6-\\sqrt{3}\\;&amp;space;m\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQxNg"},{"id":"MzA-q23","number":23,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Misalkan sebuah partikel titik bergerak dalam bidang dengan posisi awal (1,2) m pada t = 0</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">s. Kemudian setelah dua detik posisinya berubah menjadi (3,4) m dan kemudia berhenti di (-3,6) m setelah bergerak selama sepuluh detik. Kecepatan rata-rata partikel tersebut hingga ia berhenti adalah</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\">A.&nbsp;&nbsp;<img title=\"\\small \\left ( -\\frac{1}{5}\\; ,\\frac{3}{5} \\right )\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\dpi{100}&amp;space;\\fn_phv&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;\\left&amp;space;(&amp;space;-\\frac{1}{5}\\;&amp;space;,\\frac{3}{5}&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;)\" /></span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\">B.&nbsp;&nbsp;<img title=\"\\small \\left ( 1\\; ,\\: 1 \\right )\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\dpi{100}&amp;space;\\fn_phv&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;\\left&amp;space;(&amp;space;1\\;&amp;space;,\\:&amp;space;1&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;)\" /></span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\">C.&nbsp;&nbsp;<img title=\"\\small \\left ( -1\\; ,\\: 1 \\right )\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\dpi{100}&amp;space;\\fn_phv&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;\\left&amp;space;(&amp;space;-1\\;&amp;space;,\\:&amp;space;1&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;)\" /></span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\">D.&nbsp; <img title=\"\\small \\dpi{100} \\fn_phv \\small \\left ( -\\frac{2}{5}\\; ,\\frac{2}{5} \\right )\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\dpi{100}&amp;space;\\fn_phv&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;\\dpi{100}&amp;space;\\fn_phv&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;\\left&amp;space;(&amp;space;-\\frac{2}{5}\\;&amp;space;,\\frac{2}{5}&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;)\" /></span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\">E.&nbsp;&nbsp;<img title=\"\\small \\dpi{100} \\fn_phv \\small \\left ( \\frac{1}{5}\\; ,-\\frac{1}{5} \\right )\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\dpi{100}&amp;space;\\fn_phv&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;\\dpi{100}&amp;space;\\fn_phv&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;\\left&amp;space;(&amp;space;\\frac{1}{5}\\;&amp;space;,-\\frac{1}{5}&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;)\" /></span></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQxNw"},{"id":"MzA-q24","number":24,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p>Sejumlah N baterai indentik dengan potensial <img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\dpi{100}&amp;space;\\varepsilon\" />, hambatan dalam r dapat disusun seri dan kemudian digunakan untuk memberikan arus pada sebuah resistor R (Lihat gambar). Jika R&nbsp;= r, maka besar arus dalam rangkaian adalah</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"../../../../uploads/image/file/413/3.jpg\" style=\"height:163px; width:526px\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20191008064119.jpg\" style=\"height:78px; width:250px\" /></p><p>A.&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\dpi{100}&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;I=\\frac{\\varepsilon&amp;space;}{r}\\;&amp;space;\\frac{N+1}{N}\" /></p><p>B.&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\dpi{100}&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;I=\\frac{\\varepsilon&amp;space;}{r}\\;&amp;space;\\frac{N+1}{N+2}\" /></p><p>C.&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\dpi{100}&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;I=\\frac{\\varepsilon&amp;space;}{r}\\;&amp;space;\\frac{N}{N+1}\" /></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQxOA"},{"id":"MzA-q25","number":25,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Sebuah elektron dipercepat melalui beda potensial sebesar 10 juta volt. Jika diketahui massa diam elektron 0,51 MeV/c</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">, maka energi total elektron relativistik adalah</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">A.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">10,51 MeV</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">B.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">20,41 MeV</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">C.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">30,52 MeV</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">D.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">40,61 MeV</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">E.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">50,55 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">MeV</span></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQxOQ"},{"id":"MzA-q26","number":26,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p>Tiga buah bintang dengan massa yang sama, m membentuk segitiga sama sisi dengan&nbsp;sisi&nbsp;d. Ketiga bintang tersebut bergerak mengelilingi pusat massanya. Tentukan laju dari bintang v !</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"../../../../uploads/image/file/414/4.jpg\" style=\"height:233px; width:239px\" /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/uploads/media/image_media_20191008064442.jpg\" style=\"height:199px; width:204px\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p>","choices":["&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\dpi{100}&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;\\sqrt{\\frac{2GM}{d}}\" />","&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\dpi{100}&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;\\sqrt{\\frac{3GM}{d}}\" />","&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\dpi{100}&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;\\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{\\frac{GM}{d}}\" />","&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\dpi{100}&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;\\sqrt{\\frac{GM}{d}}\" />","&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\dpi{100}&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;2\\sqrt{\\frac{GM}{d}}\" />"],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQyMA"},{"id":"MzA-q27","number":27,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Sebuah partikel bergerak dari posisi&nbsp;awal&nbsp;<img title=\"3\\hat{l}+7\\hat{J}+\\hat{k}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\dpi{100}&amp;space;3\\hat{l}+7\\hat{J}+\\hat{k}\" /></span><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">meter&nbsp;dengan kecepatan konstan&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">yang besarnya&nbsp;</span><img title=\"5\\sqrt{2}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\dpi{100}&amp;space;5\\sqrt{2}\" /><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">m/s. Jika beberapa saat kemudian partikel berada di posisi&nbsp;</span><img title=\"33\\hat{l}+33\\hat{J}+55\\hat{k}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\dpi{100}&amp;space;33\\hat{l}+33\\hat{J}+55\\hat{k}\" />&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\">meter, maka vektor kecepatan partikel adalah .... m/s.</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\">A.&nbsp; <img title=\"\\dpi{100} 3\\hat{l}+4\\hat{J}+5\\hat{k}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\dpi{100}&amp;space;\\dpi{100}&amp;space;3\\hat{l}+4\\hat{J}+5\\hat{k}\" /></span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\">E.&nbsp;&nbsp;<img title=\"\\dpi{100} 3\\hat{l}-5\\hat{J}-4\\hat{k}\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\dpi{100}&amp;space;\\dpi{100}&amp;space;3\\hat{l}-5\\hat{J}-4\\hat{k}\" /></span></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQyMQ"},{"id":"MzA-q28","number":28,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Jika sebanyak 50,0 L oksigen pada suhi 27,0</span><sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">0</span></sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">C dan tekanan 2,45 atm ditekan sehingga volumnya menjadi 25,0 L dan pada saat bersamaan suhu naik menjadi 127,0</span><sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">0</span></sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">C, berapakah tekanan yang diberikan tersebut?</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">A.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">6,54 atm</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">B.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">8,70 atm</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">C.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">10,50 atm</span></p><p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">D.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">12,65 atm</span></p><p class=\"MsoListParagraph\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">E.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">15,06 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">atm</span></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQyMg"},{"id":"MzA-q29","number":29,"type":"essay","stemHtml":"<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Misalkan 1 gr air menguap pada tekanan tetap dengan tekanan 1 atm (10</span><sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">5 </span></sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">Pa). Dalam keadaan cari volumenya 1 cm</span><sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span></sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">, sedangkan dalam keadaan gas volumenya berubah menjadi 1671 cm</span><sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span></sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">. Bila keadaan campuran antara keadaan cair dan gas diabaikan dan diketahui kalir laten penguapan air adalah 2,26 x 10</span><sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">6 </span></sup><span lang=\"EN-US\">J/kg, maka perubahan energi dalam sistem di atas adalah</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\">A. 1036 J</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\">B. 1465 J</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\">C. 1877 J</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\">D. 2093 J</span></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\">E.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">2786 J</span></p>","choices":[],"discussionUrl":"https://forum.pelatihan-osn.com/arsip/discussion/MTQyMw"},{"id":"MzA-q30","number":30,"type":"pilgan","stemHtml":"<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Jika</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;diketahui&nbsp;dua&nbsp;buah&nbsp;fungsi&nbsp;gelombang&nbsp;berikut&nbsp;<img title=\"\\small \\fn_cm \\small y_{1}=A\\: sin\\left ( kx-\\omega t+\\frac{\\pi }{4} \\right )\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\fn_cm&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;\\fn_cm&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;y_{1}=A\\:&amp;space;sin\\left&amp;space;(&amp;space;kx-\\omega&amp;space;t+\\frac{\\pi&amp;space;}{4}&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;)\" />&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">,&nbsp;<img title=\"\\small y_{2}=A\\: sin\\left ( kx-\\omega t+\\phi \\right )\" src=\"https://latex.codecogs.com/gif.latex?\\fn_cm&amp;space;\\small&amp;space;y_{2}=A\\:&amp;space;sin\\left&amp;space;(&amp;space;kx-\\omega&amp;space;t+\\phi&amp;space;\\right&amp;space;)\" />&nbsp;,</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">akan</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">berinterferensi</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">satu</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">sama</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">lain,</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">dimana</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">ϕ</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">adalah</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">beda </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">fase. Jika&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">keduanya berinterferensi destruktif, maka ϕ sama dengan ...</span></p>","choices":["&nbsp; <img title=\"\\small \\fn_cm \\small n\\pi \\: dan\\: n=1,2,3, ...\" src=\"https://latex.co